  BLOCKING ONE NEURON OF 14 COSTS 30% OF THE LESSON, against 57% for
  four. That is not a result about the larynx. A single cell out of
  fourteen cannot carry more than half a lesson, so the cost is being paid
  for the ACT of blocking rather than for what is blocked -- and
  `set_reward_block` is the suspect, exactly as `set_reward_mask` was.
  `mask-unaffordable` and `compartprobe` both need re-reading, and the
  59% that closed write separation may be an instrument reading.
